  "decision_reason": "The first outer update reduced held5 success from 41 to 39, preserved no success outside the shared-prior support, retained the same three-task breadth, and remained zero on Goal and Long. Continuing macro4 would violate the preregistered requirement that outer credit improve held absolute, breadth, or retention.",
