  "earliest_failed_interface": "before the outer estimator, the two-macro correct-only fit19 warm-start does not map ordered video into a held task-conditioned code with significant incremental or process-specific closed-loop value beyond the learned language/shared prior",
  "claim_boundary": "This panel rejects the current two-macro correct-only 16-dimensional inference warm-start and the current one-direction antithetic outer update. It does not reject the inherited 56-task process frontend, fixed coordinates, train/meta action correspondence, process-identifying supervision, train-task closed-loop credit, learned progress, skill composition, runtime conditioning, video-conditioned initialization, or task-local RL in general.",
